  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Peel and chop the onion, and sauté it in olive oil until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped Australian bush tomato and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the chopped celeriac and cook until slightly tender.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the crumbled feta cheese with the chopped parsley, beaten eggs, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Transfer the cooked celeriac mixture to the prepared terracotta dish, and top with the feta cheese mixture.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 25 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with additional chopped parsley if desired."
  ],
